{
  "name": "dsh-arch-advisor-offline",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "dsh-arch-advisor-offline: fully-offline in-chat architecture consultant for DeepSeek Harness — the awesome-architecture knowledge base (tutorials/templates/cases, zh+en) is bundled into the package, no network needed. · DeepSeek Harness 离线架构顾问插件：awesome-architecture 知识库（教程/模板/案例，中英）全部打包进插件，零网络依赖。工具名带 _offline 后缀，可与在线版并存。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "architecture",
    "system-design",
    "offline",
    "knowledge-base",
    "agent"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/LeeGuanWei-a/dsh-arch-advisor-offline.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/LeeGuanWei-a/dsh-arch-advisor-offline#readme",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "content",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.1.0"
  }
}
